class UmpleToPythonNext {
    // Java's DoActivityThread with cooperative cancellation. Each state visit gets new workers, each
    // with its own cancelled token, which the activity receives as its thread parameter; exit and
    // delete set the tokens without waiting. The completion worker waits for its visit's other workers
    // and fires only while the visit is current. startAll starts it last, so it never waits for an
    // unstarted worker, and checks deletion and cancellation before each start. Activity exceptions
    // are not caught, so threading.excepthook reports them. sleep is Java's Thread.sleep for the
    // activity: it returns True as soon as the activity is cancelled.
